      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "findings\nthe strict prompt cuts hallucination (llama 28% \u2192 3%, qwen 25% \u2192 10%) but costs some accuracy \u00b7 gemma barely follows it\nnear-miss questions are the hardest \u00b7 temperature 0 \u2192 1.3 made no detectable difference\nbut asking 3 times: 33\u201358% of unanswerable questions get a made-up answer at least once (lenient prompt)",
      "originalText": "findings\nthe strict prompt cuts hallucination (llama 28% \u2192 3%, qwen 25% \u2192 10%) but costs some accuracy \u00b7 gemma barely follows it\nnear-miss questions are the hardest \u00b7 temperature 0 \u2192 1.3 made no detectable difference\nbut asking 3 times: 33\u201358% of unanswerable questions get a made-up answer at least once (lenient prompt)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-51",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
